      --  Fixed registers are deliberate: GNAT otherwise emits copy-in/out
      --  MOVs for each loop-carried vector asm operand.  v0 .. v8 hold the
      --  accumulators, v9 .. v11 are data/product scratch, v12 holds the key,
      --  and x9 .. x14 hold the six CRC words.  The clobber list leaves ABI
      --  preservation to the compiler; accumulator memory traffic stays
      --  outside the repeated label.
